{"unit_id":"MeteorNOX__DeepSeek-Balance-Whale-Widget#card-zh","repo":"MeteorNOX/DeepSeek-Balance-Whale-Widget","commit":"5247dd6813d6e4430728f39ccc63d43cda046022","type":"card","lang":"zh","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:723","lib/index.js:3548","lib/accounting.mjs:145","assets/whale-widget.js:21711"],"text":"DeepSeek Balance Whale Widget 是用于 DSH Web 和官方桌面聊天界面的余额与用量桌宠。宿主模块把挂件脚本接入页面，并提供余额、用量记录、设置和媒体资源接口；记账模块按余额观测记录每日消费并支持校正。小鲸鱼可拖动、吸附和翻转，泡泡内容、角色、图片及音效均可自定义，也能展示 DSH 每轮对话消耗和等待提示。适合希望在聊天界面查看账户余额、费用与提醒的 DSH 用户。实时 DeepSeek 余额可使用 DSH 凭据中的 API key，或使用 DSH 的 DeepSeek 登录态；会话用量估算不需要额外密钥。"}
{"unit_id":"MeteorNOX__DeepSeek-Balance-Whale-Widget#card-en","repo":"MeteorNOX/DeepSeek-Balance-Whale-Widget","commit":"5247dd6813d6e4430728f39ccc63d43cda046022","type":"card","lang":"en","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:723","lib/index.js:3548","lib/accounting.mjs:145","assets/whale-widget.js:21711"],"text":"DeepSeek Balance Whale Widget is a movable companion for DSH Web and desktop chat. It shows DeepSeek balance, daily use, and per-turn costs. Users can customize bubbles, character, images, and sounds. Live balance uses a DSH API key or account session; local usage estimates need no key."}
